<title>CHINA: Narcissus 1996 net down 71.54 pct.</title>
<headline>Narcissus 1996 net down 71.54 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	  756.839	vs	922.571</p>
<p> Net profit	  7.554	vs	 26.538</p>
<p> Net asset per share    2.10  yuan   vs   2.24 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.032 yuan   vs   0.123 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Narcissus Electric Appliances Industry Co.</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Monday. The figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed not to issue a cash dividend or bonus shares, pending approval of a shareholders' meeting.</p>
</text>
